{
 "_what": "Southwest Land Border encounters, monthly, Oct 2013 - Sep 2022 - the one-time closed-history backfill for border_encounters (register v3). Extends the live CBP series back 9 fiscal years: the Obama-2 tail, all of Trump-1, and Biden's first 21 months.",
 "_source": "DHS Office of Homeland Security Statistics, 'Immigration Enforcement and Legal Processes Monthly Tables', final edition (released 2025-01-16, data through Nov 2024; the series was discontinued after this release). Sheet 'CBP Encounter by Type + Region', column 'Total CBP -> SW Land Border'. File hand-downloaded by the creator into the bridged folder on 12 Aug 2026 and parsed against the real workbook.",
 "_verification": "Definition match PROVEN on the 24-month overlap with CBP's own live sbo-encounters series (Oct 2022 - Sep 2024): every overlapping month agrees to OHSS's published rounding (worst difference <0.2%; e.g. Dec 2023: OHSS 301,980 vs CBP 301,981). Same series, same definition - includes Title 8 apprehensions, Title 8 inadmissibles and Title 42 expulsions. Only pre-Oct-2022 months are shipped here, so the backfill can never collide with or revise the live series.",
 "_caveats": "OHSS publishes values rounded to the nearest 10 (noted on the card). Monthly SWB encounters exist only from FY2014 in this workbook - DHS's own footnotes date the encounters series to FY2014; there is NO official monthly encounters series before Oct 2013 (the old USBP apprehensions-only series is a different definition and stays in the backlog).",
